' https://plantuml.com/ja/sequence-diagram

@startuml sequence
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor       テスターX          as testerX
boundary    ブラウザ           as chrome
control     "React App"        as react1
actor       テスターY          as testerY
boundary    ブラウザ           as firefox
control     "React App"        as react2
actor       "管理者"           as admin

participant server [
    =server
    ----
    localhost:3000
]
control     "WebSocket Hander" as ws

participant frontend [
    =frontend
    ----
    localhost:5173
]

== 1 管理者がサーバーを起動する ==
admin       ->   frontend   : 1.1 start frontend
admin       ->   server     : 1.2 start server
server      ->   ws         : 1.3 start WebSocket server
activate ws
hnote over ws: topic:\nanonymous-chat-room
note left: 1.4 subscribe to the topic 'anonymous-chat-room'

== 2 テスターXがチャット画面を開く ==
testerX     ->   chrome     : 2.1 open Chrome
testerX     ->   chrome     : 2.2 to http://localhost:5173
chrome      ->   frontend   : 2.3 HTTP Request GET /
frontend    ->   chrome     : 2.4 HTTP Response (チャット画面)
chrome      ->   react1     : 2.5 start React App
activate react1
react1      ->   server     : 2.6 GET http://localhost:3000/ws

server      ->   ws         : 2.7 upgrade https: to ws:
react1  o\\--\\o ws         : 2.8 ws://localhost:3000/ws connection is kept open
note left: 2.9 WebSocket client opened
react1      ->   ws         : 2.10 subscribe to the topic

== 3 テスターYがチャット画面を開く ==
testerY     ->   firefox    : 3.1 open Firefox
testerY     ->   firefox    : 3.2 to http://localhost:5173
firefox     ->   frontend   : 3.3 HTTP Request GET /
frontend    ->   firefox    : 3.4 HTTP Response (チャット画面)
firefox    -->   react2     : 3.5 start React App
activate react2
react2      ->   server     : 3.6 GET http://localhost:3000/ws
server      ->   ws         : 3.7 upgrade http: to ws:
react2  o\\--\\o ws         : 3.8 ws://localhost:3000/ws connection is kept open
note left: 3.9 WebSocket client opened
react2      ->   ws         : 3.10 subscribe to the topic

== 4 テスターXがメッセージを送信する ==
testerX     ->   chrome     : 4.1 メッセージを入力してSend
chrome      ->   server     : 4.2 POST /messages
server      ->   ws         : 4.3 publish a message to the topic

== メッセージがsubscribers(テスターXとテスターY)に配信される ==
react1  o\\--o   ws         : the message is transfered to the subscribers
note left
UPDATE_CHAT: {id:"1785061072097",
    date:"7/26/2026, 7:17:52 PM"}
end note
chrome     <-    react1     : チャット画面が更新される
testerX    <-    chrome     : 更新されたチャット画面を見る

react2  o\\--o   ws         : the message is transfered to the subscribers
note left
UPDATE_CHAT: {id:"1785061072097",
    date:"7/26/2026, 7:17:52 PM"}
end note
firefox    <-    react2         : チャット画面が更新される
testerY    <-    firefox    : 更新されたチャット画面を見る

@enduml
